    "name": "Outbrain Engage API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Outbrain Engage API powers content recommendation widgets across the open web. It is the publisher-facing interface for retrieving personalized content recommendations (organic + sponsored) to render in Outbrain widgets. Used by the Outbrain JS Widget, the Mobile SDK (iOS/Android), Smartfeed implementations, and app mediation integrations.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Outbrain Developer Center",
      "type": "text/plain"
